(6330826, 936626, 121789, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective of this picture - the colors are vivid and the weather looks perfect! Speaking of colors . . . I''m green with envy! If I could get paid for doing anything flight related, I''d be in heaven. 8</td>', 'I like the perspective of this picture - the colors are vivid and the weather looks perfect! Speaking of colors . . . I''m green with envy! If I could get paid for doing anything flight related, I''d be in heaven. 8', '2011-02-24 10:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6330828, 936924, 121789, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what you do. I don''t know how culinary relates to flowers, or at least a flower displayed this way, anyway, unless it''s a centerpiece. It is a nice subject, but the lighting and shadows are harsh and the color of the background takes from the flower.</td>', 'I have no idea what you do. I don''t know how culinary relates to flowers, or at least a flower displayed this way, anyway, unless it''s a centerpiece. It is a nice subject, but the lighting and shadows are harsh and the color of the background takes from the flower.', '2011-02-24 10:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6330829, 937159, 121789, '<td valign="top">This is a very cool art. I have seen some very impressive works and it looks like you have all the gear to make such pieces! The B/W adds to the simplicity and utility of the image and works very well. 7</td>', 'This is a very cool art. I have seen some very impressive works and it looks like you have all the gear to make such pieces! The B/W adds to the simplicity and utility of the image and works very well. 7', '2011-02-24 10:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6330833, 937229, 121789, '<td valign="top">Once I get my cars out of the way, I''d like to delve into wood work. I have been gathering tools for it for some time, now and have completed a few projects . . . I really admire the crafty who can create with their hands - it''s like magic! The look of concentration and the sawdust in the air, the motion of the blade and lumber waiting all come together nicely to tell a story. I like this picture - 7</td>', 'Once I get my cars out of the way, I''d like to delve into wood work. I have been gathering tools for it for some time, now and have completed a few projects . . . I really admire the crafty who can create with their hands - it''s like magic! The look of concentration and the sawdust in the air, the motion of the blade and lumber waiting all come together nicely to tell a story. I like this picture - 7', '2011-02-24 10:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6330838, 936693, 121789, '<td valign="top">This is a very busy picture - all kinds of things to look at. I like the way that the tech is framed and the way he is lit. I also like the enhanced or pronounced green. 6</td>', 'This is a very busy picture - all kinds of things to look at. I like the way that the tech is framed and the way he is lit. I also like the enhanced or pronounced green. 6', '2011-02-24 11:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6330840, 936292, 121789, '<td valign="top">It''s easy to get lost in this image. I like that it seems like this is an expanse that man hasn''t eff''d up - very cool! 7</td>', 'It''s easy to get lost in this image. I like that it seems like this is an expanse that man hasn''t eff''d up - very cool! 7', '2011-02-24 11:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6330844, 937246, 121789, '<td valign="top">Do the colors pink and blue have anything to do with this experiment? Maybe a little mad science going on? This is a very clean and clear picture - nice lighting and balance. 7</td>', 'Do the colors pink and blue have anything to do with this experiment? Maybe a little mad science going on? This is a very clean and clear picture - nice lighting and balance. 7', '2011-02-24 11:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6330847, 937265, 121789, '<td valign="top">It might be that camera mucking up the whole works! Unique perspective, but busy with too many things to try to see, if that makes any sense. 6</td>', 'It might be that camera mucking up the whole works! Unique perspective, but busy with too many things to try to see, if that makes any sense. 6', '2011-02-24 11:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
