(6330855, 937237, 121789, '<td valign="top">I have all kinds of respect for anyone who successfully pilots one of those machines over the highways with all the other drivers out there doing their own thing. I am not sure that the B/W does anything for this image but blend the trucks - I mean, I think that in color this photo would have more impact. 6</td>', 'I have all kinds of respect for anyone who successfully pilots one of those machines over the highways with all the other drivers out there doing their own thing. I am not sure that the B/W does anything for this image but blend the trucks - I mean, I think that in color this photo would have more impact. 6', '2011-02-24 11:11:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6330856, 936788, 121789, '<td valign="top">Wow - what a huge project! What a great thing to be a part of! With everything going on here, the perspective of the photographer using the expanse of the sky adds to the "bigness" of this image.  7</td>', 'Wow - what a huge project! What a great thing to be a part of! With everything going on here, the perspective of the photographer using the expanse of the sky adds to the "bigness" of this image.  7', '2011-02-24 11:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
