(6330882, 937211, 121789, '<td valign="top">"Statistical Design of Experiments". I need to wrap my head around that for a bit to figure it out. I''ll end up over thinking it and get a head-ache, for sure. I like the picture, it has good clarity and is interesting. I like the machines all lined up - the depth of focus seems to add individuality to the similarities. The B/W adds - 8</td>', '"Statistical Design of Experiments". I need to wrap my head around that for a bit to figure it out. I''ll end up over thinking it and get a head-ache, for sure. I like the picture, it has good clarity and is interesting. I like the machines all lined up - the depth of focus seems to add individuality to the similarities. The B/W adds - 8', '2011-02-24 11:45:31.000000', NULL, 1),
