(6330893, 936932, 121789, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what to do with this . . . my imagination needs a little more for a jump start, I think, for this to work for me. If anything, there looks like there is all kinds of . . . texture . . . to this photo. The way the colors separate is interesting, too. 6</td>', 'I don''t know what to do with this . . . my imagination needs a little more for a jump start, I think, for this to work for me. If anything, there looks like there is all kinds of . . . texture . . . to this photo. The way the colors separate is interesting, too. 6', '2011-02-24 11:57:40.000000', NULL, 1),
