(6332905, 937246, 83754, '<td valign="top">Overall I really like this.  May have been slightly more effective if the petri plates in the back left were not truncated: either by pulling back slightly to get them in, or removing the excess plates from the top to get them in the frame.  At the same time, shooting in a hood means having to work with confined space.</td>', 'Overall I really like this.  May have been slightly more effective if the petri plates in the back left were not truncated: either by pulling back slightly to get them in, or removing the excess plates from the top to get them in the frame.  At the same time, shooting in a hood means having to work with confined space.', '2011-02-26 11:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
