(6333432, 937265, 108069, '<td valign="top">I think I would have preferred "F You A..." as a terminator reference for a title, but you were wise to avoid that one. But the simple truth is that this is not only a brilliantly exposed and detailed photo, but the composition is really otherworldly. Great stuff.<br/> <br/>Back to say Domo Arigato Mr. Roboto. No? Fine. I''ll move along.</td>', 'I think I would have preferred "F You A..." as a terminator reference for a title, but you were wise to avoid that one. But the simple truth is that this is not only a brilliantly exposed and detailed photo, but the composition is really otherworldly. Great stuff. Back to say Domo Arigato Mr. Roboto. No? Fine. I''ll move along.', '2011-02-26 21:30:14.000000', NULL, 1),
