(6338110, 937229, 121949, '<td valign="top">Okay, obviously people had a problem with me not wearing safety gear. For the record I do usually wear ear protection, and I know I should wear eye protection but I just hate it. I can''t see what I am doing they get all fogged up, anyway. I did not want to wear them for the shot. For one thing it wasn''t practical for a self portrait, running back and forth trying to start a saw was hard enough. And really it''s not as dangerous as it looks, in the picture my hand is nearly a half a foot away from the blade. <br/> <br/>I know most of you were just giving me a hard time, but I wanted to explain myself anyway. <br/> <br/>I am very happy with my score and a top 10!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Okay, obviously people had a problem with me not wearing safety gear. For the record I do usually wear ear protection, and I know I should wear eye protection but I just hate it. I can''t see what I am doing they get all fogged up, anyway. I did not want to wear them for the shot. For one thing it wasn''t practical for a self portrait, running back and forth trying to start a saw was hard enough. And really it''s not as dangerous as it looks, in the picture my hand is nearly a half a foot away from the blade.  I know most of you were just giving me a hard time, but I wanted to explain myself anyway.  I am very happy with my score and a top 10! ', '2011-03-02 00:07:27.000000', NULL, 0),
