(6342253, 937156, 98349, '<td valign="top">I am very surprised at the score for this one. I am a mechanic but this was not taken at work, rather my friends garage. We were struggling with the top bolt on the bell housing during the clutch replacement. So I had a little time to snap this, get my camera full of oil and then get back to work. Thank you all for the comments.</td>', 'I am very surprised at the score for this one. I am a mechanic but this was not taken at work, rather my friends garage. We were struggling with the top bolt on the bell housing during the clutch replacement. So I had a little time to snap this, get my camera full of oil and then get back to work. Thank you all for the comments.', '2011-03-05 16:44:14.000000', NULL, 0),
